# m6_identity: a long god-mode run (debug_god at 31: hits are ignored, so the run is
# deterministic for 12000 updates) through two stages and their bosses into stage 3 with
# every weapon at high level, three forks and three hold-B rewinds. Input: A at 30, still
# fire 60..239, then m2_play's sweep (up 40 / hold 20 / down 40 / hold 20) to 12000, B held
# 5100..5119, 7000..7019 and 8228..8257. debug_history_check (0 = the world rebuilt from
# keyframe + input log is identical, every field) is checked with ghosts, beams, seekers and
# crates in flight, on held frames and on the first frames after each release; it is 0 on
# every frame from 31 on (checked frame by frame when re-pinned; the pins are a sample).
# Re-pinned for the catch-up clock (waves come sooner on a thin field, so the bosses and the
# crates come earlier): the third hold moved from 10500..10529 to 10780..10809 so that it
# still went back past a boss's spawn (the Schrodinbug's then; the Mandelbug's before).
# Re-pinned for the mode paces (NORMAL: the table clock hurries, 3 ticks a tick, only on an
# empty field): the stages run longer again, the run no longer reaches the third boss and
# the Mandelbug comes at 8220, so the third hold moved from 10780..10809 to 8228..8257 to go
# back past the Mandelbug's spawn; the second hold (7000) now falls in stage 2's waves with
# B5 seekers in flight instead of in the Mandelbug's fight.
# Weapon (kind * 10 + level, F 0, A 1, B 2): F2 at 852, F3 1534, F4 2166, F5 2662, A5 3430
# (swap), B5 6790, F5 9619, then an A and an F crate in turn at 11138 and 11143. Forks at
# 1783, 2594 and 3075 (3 ghosts). The Heisenbug (3407) dies at 4620 (stage 2 from there),
# the Mandelbug (8220, again at 8311) at 9646 (stage 3); the shield (2057) is never used up
# under god mode.
# - 3430: A5 (3 beams) and three ghosts in the Heisenbug's fight.
# - Hold 1: 5100 (first held frame, game tick 5067) .. 5119 (tick 5029, fuel 140), in
#   stage 2's waves; 5120 is the release (no tick), 5121 the first live tick.
# - Hold 2: 7000 .. 7019 with B5 seekers from the ship and the three ghosts' level-1 seekers
#   in flight (more than 30 bolts), release 7020, live 7021; 7484 the peak (over 60).
# - Hold 3: 8228 .. 8257 (tick 8015, fuel 120), release 8258, live 8259: the Mandelbug
#   spawned at 8220 (tick 8068); 8230 (tick 8069) still has it, 8231 (tick 8067) is before
#   its spawn (no boss, the WARNING again), and it comes again at 8311.
#   11999 is the last update.
--frames 12000 --call-at "31 debug_god" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_weapon,debug_forks,debug_stage_clears,debug_world_size --at "2300 debug_forks == 1" --at "2300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2593 debug_forks == 1" --at "2594 debug_forks == 2" --at "2661 debug_weapon == 4" --at "2662 debug_weapon == 5" --at "3074 debug_forks == 2" --at "3075 debug_forks == 3" --at "3407 debug_boss_id == 0" --at "3429 debug_weapon == 5" --at "3430 debug_weapon == 15" --at "3430 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3600 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4619 debug_stage_clears == 0" --at "4620 debug_stage_clears == 1" --at "4890 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5100 debug_state == 5" --at "5100 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5110 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5119 debug_state == 5" --at "5119 debug_game_tick == 5029" --at "5119 debug_fuel == 140" --at "5119 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5120 debug_state == 1" --at "5120 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5121 debug_history_check == 0" --at "6300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "6789 debug_weapon == 15" --at "6790 debug_weapon == 25" --at "7000 debug_state == 5" --at "7000 debug_bolts > 30" --at "7010 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7019 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7020 debug_state == 1" --at "7020 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7021 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7484 debug_bolts > 60" --at "7484 debug_history_check == 0" --at "8000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "8219 debug_boss_id == 255" --at "8220 debug_boss_id == 1" --at "8228 debug_state == 5" --at "8230 debug_boss_id == 1" --at "8231 debug_boss_id == 255" --at "8231 debug_history_check == 0" --at "8245 debug_history_check == 0" --at "8257 debug_game_tick == 8015" --at "8257 debug_fuel == 120" --at "8257 debug_history_check == 0" --at "8258 debug_state == 1" --at "8258 debug_history_check == 0" --at "8259 debug_history_check == 0" --at "8310 debug_boss_id == 255" --at "8311 debug_boss_id == 1" --at "9000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "9618 debug_weapon == 25" --at "9619 debug_weapon == 5" --at "9646 debug_stage_clears == 2" --at "10000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "11138 debug_weapon == 15" --at "11143 debug_weapon == 5" --at "11999 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_forks == 3" --expect "debug_weapon == 5" --expect "debug_stage_clears == 2" --expect "debug_state == 1"
